<!--
    Overlay on Playnite Default/Media.xaml.
    Icon set: Material Symbols, Sharp style, filled (Apache-2.0, info/LICENSE-material-symbols.txt). Solid,
    square-cornered glyphs are the closest open set to the solid white icons on the Counter-Strike 2 navbar (home,
    watch, settings, quit); the game's own icons are Valve's artwork and are not bundled. icons.json lists every
    source. The paths are the SVGs' own, moved from 0,-960 onto a 0..960 grid.

    One geometry per role Playnite's chrome needs (Icon + role), plus the dropdown, submenu and check indicators and the
    game page icons, drawn by IconTemplate in the inherited foreground. Library is the navbar's home glyph, Options the
    navbar's settings gear. IconMainMenu is this theme's own mark: a crosshair (four bars around a gap and a center
    dot), drawn by hand, not taken from any game file.

    Menu icons (main menu, game menu) are theme file paths: Playnite's MenuHelpers.GetIcon loads a string resource as an
    image through ThemeFile. Images/Material holds them at 48px in baseText, the favorite star in the T gold (t-color)
    and quit and remove in negativeColor.
-->
